Subject: [PATCH] Order explicit player checkpoints with lifecycle saves


diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/players/PlayerList.java b/net/minecraft/server/players/PlayerList.java
index f189cfa92c2d67a193820ec0928c34c630af9417..421020e3f35323d385b88098272921ef959cda94 100644
